// The window, taskbar and Explorer icon on Windows. GDK gives every window
// the first icon in the .exe, falling back to GTK's own DLL icon if there is
// none. dance._39music.MikuExpoCountdown.ico is rendered from the .svg next
// to it (16, 24, 32, 48, 64 and 256 px); regenerate it if the .svg changes:
//   magick -background none -density 600 dance._39music.MikuExpoCountdown.svg -resize 256x256 icon.png
//   magick icon.png -define icon:auto-resize=256,64,48,32,24,16 dance._39music.MikuExpoCountdown.ico
1 ICON "dance._39music.MikuExpoCountdown.ico"
